WEBVTT

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:11.440
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:13.780
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:17.410
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:20.910
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:25.460
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.090
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.680
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:40.390
by ridding you...

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:43.560
...of your other love?

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:48.150
At sunset,

00:00:48.770 --> 00:00:50.690
when the children go home,

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:54.610
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:58.450
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:00.540
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.330
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:10.000
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:11.840
In a city without light,

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:15.720
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:19.140
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:21.430
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:24.930
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:34.690
I'm Kurata Sana, a 6th grader
and TV personality

00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:36.950
affiliated with Gekidan Komawari.

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:39.950
My beloved Mama is a famous novelist,
who has even won the Aoki Laureate Prize.

00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:41.950
The chipmunk on her head is Maro-chan.

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:43.950
My former boyfriend, Sagami Rei-kun.

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:47.290
Right now, he's earnestly on the way
to becoming a fine manager.

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:48.960
The mysterious white bat straight man.

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:51.960
I'm telling you right now,
Babbit is not a fox.

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:54.210
Hayama Akito, my natural enemy.

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:57.630
Even so, right now, when I'm
around him, I'm relaxed for some reason.

00:01:57.630 --> 00:01:59.340
Tsuyoshi-kun and Aya-chan,

00:01:59.340 --> 00:02:01.890
who were brought together by a present
and easily became close.

00:02:01.930 --> 00:02:03.930
But I'm not jealous of them!

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:06.520
And this is Tsuyoshi-kun's
younger sister, Aono-chan,

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:08.020
who's in 2nd grade.

00:02:09.270 --> 00:02:12.270
So you see, this problem
is done like this...

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:16.610
Yay! It's over! It's over!
We can go home!

00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:18.660
Okay, okay, understood, we'll end class,

00:02:18.660 --> 00:02:22.950
but in return, the remaining problems
are your homework.

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:24.290
--Homework!?

00:02:24.290 --> 00:02:27.250
You can't give those for homework, chief!
You can't! You can't!

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:29.290
What was that "chief" for?

00:02:29.290 --> 00:02:31.000
They're easy, they're easy.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:33.420
You'll finish these problems right away,
so hang in there.

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:36.630
Say, Tsuyoshi-kun, shall we
do our homework together?

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:40.300
Mm-hmm, but I have to keep
an eye on the house today.

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:41.720
Okay then, we'll do it
at your place, Tsuyoshi-kun.

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:45.310
I'll go home and tell my mom,
then go over to your place.

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:48.270
Isn't that nice, isn't that nice?
I'm so jealous.

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:50.940
They're in love-love, huh?
Tsuyoshi and Aya.

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:52.730
They're going to do their
homework together, huh?

00:02:52.730 --> 00:02:54.570
Maybe I'll horn in, too.

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:57.650
Don't you dare, Sana-chan!

00:02:57.650 --> 00:02:59.320
Right! You'll be in their way!

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:01.860
But... but they're going
to be doing my homework!

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:04.910
--They'll do it, they'll do it, okay, okay?
--Those two never said
they'd do your homework.

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:08.910
Up until half a year ago, Tsuyoshi-kun
was in love-love with you, Sana-chan.

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:12.250
Though you didn't know
how he felt about you.

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:17.000
--Wait! Wait! I'm coming, too!
I'm coming too!
--You just want them to do your homework!

00:03:18.260 --> 00:03:21.130
"There Is a Reason For These Presents"

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:25.010
Those two are in love-love, huh?

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:27.350
This is the season for companionship,
after all.

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:29.350
That's no fun.

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:31.770
For one thing,
Tsuyoshi only came to like Sugita

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:33.980
because she gave him something,
didn't he?

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:36.980
He was just lured in by her.

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:40.320
What's the matter, Tsuyoshi-kun?

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:43.660
It felt like someone was watching us.

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:47.080
Are you sure it wasn't your imagination?
Never mind that, let's get going.

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:57.670
Now Aono, you're going
to spoil your dinner.

00:03:57.670 --> 00:03:59.670
But these cookies are so delicious.

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:02.010
It will be done right away, okay?

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:04.010
Huh? Are those cookies homemade?

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:05.340
Well, yeah.

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:08.680
Aya-chan made them for you,
huh Big Brother?

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:10.020
Well, yeah.

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:12.020
Oh, did Sugita-san come over?

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:14.350
Well, yeah!

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:17.270
I made these yesterday.
They're cocoa cookies.

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:21.030
Delicious!

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:22.030
Really?

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:24.030
Mm-hmm! They taste like cocoa.

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:25.360
Let's do our homework.

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:26.030
Mm-hmm.

00:04:26.030 --> 00:04:30.200
Whew, the winter is hot
this year. It's got me beat.

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:33.620
Isn't that nice, Tsuyoshi?
You're popular with the girls.

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:35.630
Huh? I'm popular?

00:04:35.630 --> 00:04:38.960
After all, you got chocolate from
Sana-chan last year or whenever, right?

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:41.960
You got cookies from Sugita-san
on your birthday this year.

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:44.630
And then, remember,
back in kindergarten,

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:48.300
you got that panda candy from Sayuri-chan,
who was in the tulip class, didn't you?

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:51.970
We're talking about a
long time ago now, right, Mom?

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:53.980
Yeah, that did happen, huh?

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:55.650
You're cool, Big Brother!

00:04:55.650 --> 00:04:59.320
Yeah, well... Oh, but don't
tell Aya-chan about that stuff.

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:02.990
Aya-chan is the fairly
yakimochi ("jealous") type, after all.

00:05:02.990 --> 00:05:04.990
What's "yakimochi"?

00:05:04.990 --> 00:05:07.990
Yakimochi ("toasted rice cakes"),
you see, is just yakimochi.

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:09.950
Speaking of yakimochi,
there's this isobeyaki shop

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:11.660
in Shibuya that I went
to earlier that's-

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:13.330
We don't need to hear about it.

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:16.250
Well, I'm going to go
over my homework again,

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:19.670
so when dinner is ready, call me, okay?

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:23.210
Big Brother, your fly is open!
I can see your underpants!

00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:29.350
How long has that been open!?
Did Aya-chan see it? How embarrassing!

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:31.970
Tsuyoshi-kun is, after all,
still our Tsuyoshi-kun.

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:39.310
Huh? What's this?

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:41.320
A present for me?

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:43.990
Yo, Tsuyoshi, good morning!

00:05:43.990 --> 00:05:48.660
"Tsuyoshi-kun, I love you!"

00:05:43.990 --> 00:05:48.660
This isn't Aya-chan's handwriting!

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:51.990
Isn't that nice, Tsuyoshi?
You're popular with the girls.

00:05:51.990 --> 00:05:54.660
I don't know what to do about this.

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:56.660
Ah, Tsuyoshi-kun, good morning!

00:05:56.660 --> 00:06:00.330
Aya-chan! G- good... good morning!

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:01.340
Is something wrong?

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:04.840
N- nothing at all. I'm going
to go on ahead, okay?

00:06:05.970 --> 00:06:07.340
Tsuyoshi-kun...

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:09.760
Akito-kun!

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:13.350
Hey, don't run in the hall!

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:19.650
We should be okay here.
Akito-kun, look at this!

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:21.360
What is that?

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:23.320
It was in my shoe locker.

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:25.320
It's not from Sugita?

00:06:25.320 --> 00:06:29.700
No! No! It's not Aya-chan!
It doesn't have the sender's name on it.

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:31.280
What should I do?

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:33.950
I don't know how to handle this.
I've got Aya-chan.

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:36.950
Well, double-dipping, huh?
Nice going, Tsuyoshi.

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:39.960
No, I couldn't double-dip.

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:42.630
Double-dipping? What's double-dipping?

00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:45.380
Seeing two girls at the same time.

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:49.300
--Tsuyoshi-kun, let's have some fun!

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:54.310
--This way! This way! This way, I say!

00:06:56.640 --> 00:07:00.310
It's no use! I can't do it, Akito-kun!

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:03.560
After you fell in love
with Kurata and Sugita

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:04.980
when they gave you
chocolate and cookies,

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:07.990
you're going to ignore this one
after she gives you candy?

00:07:07.990 --> 00:07:12.660
Tsuyoshi-kun, you're terrible! What is it
about my present that you don't like?

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:14.660
Oh, no...

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:18.330
It's hard being
a popular guy, huh? Later.

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:19.330
Akito-kun!

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:22.670
What should I do!? Akito-kun!

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:24.000
"Who could it be?"

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:24.000
Although...

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:29.010
"6th Year 3rd Class"

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:26.550
Okay, please open up
your homework notebooks

00:07:26.550 --> 00:07:29.340
and go over your answers
with those around you.

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:32.590
Who could it have been
that gave me the present?

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:35.970
Was it one of the girls in
this class? Hisae-chan, maybe?

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:36.930
Teremi-chan, maybe?

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:39.600
--Maiko-chan, maybe? Rumiko-chan, maybe?
--Tsuyoshi-kun!

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:41.270
--Eriko-chan, maybe?
--Tsuyoshi-kun!

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:43.940
Wow, what am I going to do?

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:46.610
Whoa, Tsuyoshi-kun,
your homework is perfect!

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:50.280
Say, how do you do this?
Teach me! Teach me!

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:53.280
Sana-chan? Could it be you, Sana-chan?

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:57.620
It turns out that I really
do like you, Tsuyoshi-kun.

00:07:57.620 --> 00:08:01.620
Sana-chan, I can't!
It'll just make trouble for me!

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:03.620
Sana-chan, I'll teach you how.

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:06.130
Really? Aya-chan, lucky!

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:10.300
That was just a little
"yakimochi" from Aya-chan.

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:11.630
So that's it. I get it.

00:08:11.630 --> 00:08:16.640
Say, Sana-chan, do you think
Tsuyoshi-kun is acting a little strange?

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:18.310
Strange?

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:20.640
Oh, my! Not just a little strange,
that's quite strange!

00:08:20.640 --> 00:08:25.650
He seems to be avoiding me somewhat, too.
What could be the matter?

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:28.650
All righty! Right now,
aside from you, Aya-chan,

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:29.980
there's one other of
Tsuyoshi-kun's friends-

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:31.490
right here!

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:34.610
Could I see you a minute, Hayama?

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:36.280
Just call me vocally.

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:39.290
Huh? Someone gave Tsuyoshi-kun
a present? Who was it?

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:41.290
I don't know who.

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:43.120
You mean, despite the fact

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:45.620
that everyone knows Aya-chan and
Tsuyoshi-kun are in love-love?

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:47.290
That's got nothing to do with anything.

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:48.630
Whoever else they may
be in love-love with,

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:49.630
when you like someone, you like them.

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:52.300
Yeah, but still,
there's no way that Tsuyoshi-kun

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:53.970
would become fickle over this girl,

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:56.430
just because he got a present from her-

00:08:59.310 --> 00:09:01.850
Here are some cookies I made myself.

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:04.310
"Keep hanging in there. -Aya"

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:08.980
I did use to like you, Sana-chan,
but I'm over it.

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:12.990
Now I think that Aya-chan
is better for me, you see.

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:18.660
Tsuyoshi-kun has a real weakness
when it comes to presents, huh?

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:23.000
When we were in kindergarten,
he was quite popular with girls.

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:26.040
He had a weird habit
of getting stuck on them

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:27.330
whenever he received
anything from them.

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:29.670
Sayuri-chan! Sayuri-chan!

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:32.590
Then, starting a little
after we began going to school,

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:36.260
it got so he never got presents
from anyone outside his family,

00:09:35.930 --> 00:09:39.430
"Ignore"

00:09:36.260 --> 00:09:39.930
and just as I thought he had
gotten over that strange habit...

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:41.600
Here! Chocolate for you!

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:44.600
...thanks to you,
it returned with a vengeance.

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:47.940
The way you say it makes it
sound like this is my fault.

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:49.440
"Exactly right!"

00:09:49.610 --> 00:09:51.570
It was Valentine's chocolate, right?

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:54.280
It's not surprising
that his habit would return.

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:56.700
Say then, are you saying

00:09:56.700 --> 00:09:58.950
that Tsuyoshi-kun falls for any girl
who gives him a present?

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:00.620
The possibility...

00:10:00.620 --> 00:10:01.950
The possibility?

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:03.950
...is 99%.

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:06.290
99%!?

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:09.290
No, I'd say 100%.

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:11.040
Quite a spectacle.

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:13.250
"What to do?"

00:10:13.250 --> 00:10:15.300
Hey, Sana-chan, how did it go?

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:18.300
What did Hayama-kun
say about Tsuyoshi-kun?

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:20.970
N- nothing, much... He didn't
really say, like, anything...

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:21.640
Really?

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:23.680
Yeah, like, really...

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:27.640
Thank goodness. Then I'm sure
it must be my imagination, huh?

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:31.270
Aya-chan, you really do like
Tsuyoshi-kun, don't you?

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:35.860
Oh, again!?

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:43.620
"Tsuyoshi-kun, I love you"

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:47.620
Are you done cleaning, Tsuyoshi-kun?

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:48.960
Aya-chan!

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:50.250
Shall we go home together?

00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:51.630
Yeah, the two of you!

00:10:51.630 --> 00:10:55.300
Uh, sorry, I'm in a bit of a hurry,
so I'm heading out first, okay?

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:57.630
Bye!

00:10:57.630 --> 00:10:59.630
What's going on with Tsuyoshi-kun?

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:03.930
Sana-chan, it looks like
Tsuyoshi-kun doesn't like me anymore.

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:05.600
Aya-chan...

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:07.980
I'm sorry, Aya-chan.

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:11.650
I'm not fit to go home
with you right now, Aya-chan.

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:14.320
I can't double-dip, after all.

00:11:14.320 --> 00:11:17.280
Then you don't have to double-dip,
do you?

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:20.650
Hey, you!!

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:23.320
Ah, Sana-chan!

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:25.490
I'm sorry! Please, look the other way!

00:11:28.660 --> 00:11:32.960
What's this? "Tsuyoshi-kun,
I love you so, so, so much"?

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:35.000
That's dreadful.

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:38.090
Come along, now...

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:43.180
No! Aya-chan, help me!

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:51.940
Oh, dear. Tsuyoshi-kun
is already falling apart.

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:57.440
Gomi-kun, you really
do like gomi ("trash"), huh?

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:07.490
Sensei, is there anything
you want right now?

00:12:07.530 --> 00:12:09.160
Let's see... A space shuttle, maybe.

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:11.830
No, Sensei! Your manuscript!
Your manuscript!

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:14.210
Hush, would you?

00:12:14.210 --> 00:12:16.500
Shimura-san, is there
anything you want right now?

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:19.510
Let's see... perhaps a paid vacation.

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:24.890
I can't get either
one of these on my own.

00:12:24.890 --> 00:12:27.890
Thinking up Christmas
presents isn't easy.

00:12:27.890 --> 00:12:32.140
Okay, in that case,
a spare tire for her indoor car,

00:12:32.140 --> 00:12:35.150
and for Shimura-san,
let's go with a new apron.

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:37.400
The question is,
what to get for Sana-chan.

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:39.480
A stuffed animal
would be too childish.

00:12:39.480 --> 00:12:42.820
She'll be in middle school next year,
and she has more money than I do.

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:45.780
Okay, when in doubt, go orthodox-

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:49.240
I-I c-can't w-write!

00:12:51.160 --> 00:12:55.170
Sana-chan, what's the matter?
There's no "Child's Toy" taping today.

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:57.500
I need to see Zenjiro-san.

00:12:57.500 --> 00:13:01.510
Sana-chan, if you're having some sort
of trouble, you could always tell me.

00:13:01.510 --> 00:13:04.510
Rei-kun, you just need
to take us to Zenjiro-san.

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:09.180
This has been "Zenjiro's Get the
Goil Show"! See you again next week!

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:11.850
Good job, awl!

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:14.850
It's Zenjiro-chan!

00:13:14.850 --> 00:13:16.520
Okay, okay, okay!

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:17.860
Please accept this, Zenjiro-chan!

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:20.860
Okay, okay, ladies, thank you!
Okay! Okay!

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:23.860
Sane-yan, I can't see
in front of me! Where's the ear!?

00:13:23.860 --> 00:13:25.860
This way! This way!

00:13:25.860 --> 00:13:27.870
There, there, please get in.

00:13:27.870 --> 00:13:28.530
Zen-chan!

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:30.200
--Ah, don't push! Please let me by!
--Wah! Sana-chan?

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:32.120
Ah, it's Zenjiro-san!

00:13:32.120 --> 00:13:34.790
What is this, your car, Sana-chan?

00:13:34.790 --> 00:13:36.120
All righty then...

00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:39.540
You know what? There's something
we'd like you to teach us, Zenjiro-san.

00:13:39.540 --> 00:13:40.880
As it turns out...

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:46.380
There aren't enough lifetimes in
the woild that you could offuh me

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:48.140
to marry the poison who gave me these.

00:13:48.140 --> 00:13:49.470
I mean, really.

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:51.810
Aren't you showing off a little there?

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:53.470
Just a little.

00:13:53.470 --> 00:13:55.520
Remembuh, my populah
little Tsuyoshi-kun,

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:57.480
presents are like a young goil's heart.

00:13:57.480 --> 00:13:59.150
You've gotta accept them.

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:02.150
But Tsuyoshi-kun has a
terrible habit of falling for girls

00:14:02.150 --> 00:14:04.820
when they give him presents.

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:07.150
That's a happy life to live, isn't it?

00:14:07.150 --> 00:14:08.450
If they're giving you presents,

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:10.490
then they must awlready be taken
with you, right Tsuyoshi-kun?

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:12.830
Let them keep fawling for you, I say.

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:14.160
Just a minute!

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:16.330
In that case,
what will happen to Aya-chan,

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:18.170
who is deeply in love-love
with Tsuyoshi-kun!?

00:14:18.170 --> 00:14:21.500
Tsuyoshi-kun already has kind
and adorable Aya-chan for a girlfriend!

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:24.510
If he really likes that goil,
then there's no problem, is there?

00:14:24.510 --> 00:14:27.840
But for the longest time,
I've had a weakness for presents.

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:32.140
Whenever I get a present, I immediately
fall in love with the one giving it.

00:14:32.140 --> 00:14:34.930
Who's the goil that
gave you the present?

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:38.140
Is she a nice-uh goil
than this Aya-chan?

00:14:38.140 --> 00:14:39.810
I don't know who.

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:41.360
--What!?
--What!?

00:14:43.820 --> 00:14:47.280
Sana-chan doesn't discuss
these things with me,

00:14:47.280 --> 00:14:49.820
even though I'm right there beside her.

00:14:49.820 --> 00:14:51.820
This week's Zenjiro-chan!

00:14:51.820 --> 00:14:54.830
Aah! I'm so attractive,
I can't stand it!

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:57.830
Geez, Tsuyoshi-kun is so indecisive!

00:14:57.830 --> 00:14:59.830
The oden is done cooking.

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:03.170
At this point, the only thing I can do
is appeal to this girl directly.

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:04.840
What do you mean, appeal?

00:15:04.840 --> 00:15:08.170
You know, to please
give up on Tsuyoshi-kun.

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:10.510
Tsuyoshi-kun just has
a weakness for presents.

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:13.850
All you're really doing is
causing trouble for Tsuyoshi-kun.

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:15.510
Here goes!

00:15:15.510 --> 00:15:19.520
♪ It's terribly troubling
to love-love Tsuyoshi! ♪

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:21.520
♪ He loves cute little Aya-chan, ♪

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:23.520
♪ but Present Girl
is getting in the way! ♪

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:25.520
♪ Indifferently,
Tsuyoshi-kun wobbles that way, ♪

00:15:25.520 --> 00:15:27.860
♪ even though he has Aya-chan!
That's no good! ♪

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:29.860
♪ That's why Sana-chan will
do her best-best-best! ♪

00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:33.120
♪ Sana-chan, champion of justice! ♪

00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:36.450
But Sana-chan, even if you drive
this girl away from him this time,

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:39.580
someone else could give him
a present, couldn't they?

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:43.790
Ah, Rei-kun, Rei-kun, what should I do?

00:15:43.790 --> 00:15:49.090
Sana-chan! All right, let me take care
of this! I'll try to find out who she is!

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:52.590
Good for you, Rei-kun!

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:03.480
Hey, did you hear about Tsuyoshi-kun?

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:05.810
I heard, I heard!
What's going to happen?

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:08.820
If he breaks up with Aya-chan,
will he be going with this other girl?

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:11.490
And she has to have some courage
to give him presents like this, huh?

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:14.870
Tsuyoshi-kun and Aya-chan were
already in love-love, and all.

00:16:17.160 --> 00:16:19.500
Aya-chan...

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:22.500
Hey, I heard Tsuyoshi had
moved on to another girl!

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:25.580
Eh? Really? Not bad!

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:29.510
Ah, Tsuyoshi is here!

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:48.440
Tsuyoshi-kun...

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:50.400
A- Aya-chan...

00:16:51.490 --> 00:16:53.280
Tsuyoshi-kun, you're so handsome,

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:56.160
it's only natural that
you'd be so popular. But I...

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:59.490
I trust you, Tsuyoshi-kun.

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:03.160
Aya-chan...

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:24.270
Va-room!

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:37.700
That's it!

00:17:40.120 --> 00:17:43.120
Gomi, ltami, and Yasuda!

00:17:43.120 --> 00:17:45.580
Those jerks!

00:17:48.460 --> 00:17:51.460
"Aya-chan, I... I... I..."

00:17:51.460 --> 00:17:54.130
What an idiot!

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:58.470
You sure got Tsuyoshi good, huh?

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:00.350
--Hayama-san!

00:18:02.470 --> 00:18:04.730
--H- h- hi there...

00:18:07.140 --> 00:18:09.440
Why, you!

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:12.820
You'll pay for this!

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:14.820
It wasn't...

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:16.700
...me...

00:18:18.820 --> 00:18:21.490
--We're very sorry.

00:18:21.490 --> 00:18:24.490
See? This was all a stupid
practical joke on their part.

00:18:24.490 --> 00:18:28.540
So just think of this as being a little
leopard bite, and forget about it.

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:32.710
They saw how, after I had given
Tsuyoshi-kun that chocolate,

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:34.090
he turned his interest to Aya-chan

00:18:34.090 --> 00:18:36.050
like it was nothing
after she gave him cookies,

00:18:36.050 --> 00:18:39.050
and thought
"what's the deal with this guy?"

00:18:39.050 --> 00:18:42.510
but I think Tsuyoshi-kun's love
towards Aya-chan's is the real deal.

00:18:42.510 --> 00:18:44.060
Right, Tsuyoshi-kun?

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:47.060
Aya-chan, I...

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:49.390
--Tsuyoshi-kun!
--Tsuyoshi-kun!

00:18:49.390 --> 00:18:54.400
It was just a prank, and yet I was so...
my heart was so fickle!

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:56.400
I'm sorry, Aya-chan!

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:57.900
I'm sorry!

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:02.070
Big Brother, what's wrong?

00:19:02.070 --> 00:19:04.080
It's nothing.

00:19:04.080 --> 00:19:06.410
Cheer up. Here.

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:10.960
Aono made this in school today.
It's a present for you, Big Brother.

00:19:13.420 --> 00:19:15.210
Hello!

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:21.090
--I have a package for you.
--Yay! Yay! Yay! Yay! A package! Yay!

00:19:21.090 --> 00:19:23.430
We don't want it!

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:26.890
I want to go to a faraway land,
where they don't have presents,

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:29.100
together with Aya-chan!

00:19:29.100 --> 00:19:31.520
"Sugita"

00:19:39.360 --> 00:19:41.530
--Good morning.

00:19:44.370 --> 00:19:47.040
You're late, Tsuyoshi-kun...

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:50.040
Oh, Aya-chan...

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:52.040
Why are you hiding!?

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:55.040
--Go tell her "good morning"!
Come on, come on!
--I can't... I couldn't...

00:19:55.040 --> 00:19:56.710
--Good morning, Aya-chan.

00:19:56.710 --> 00:19:58.300
Good morning.

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:06.050
Um, Sugita-san...

00:20:06.050 --> 00:20:07.060
Yes?

00:20:07.060 --> 00:20:09.390
Here. Um...

00:20:09.390 --> 00:20:12.310
I happen to see you
every once in a while,

00:20:12.310 --> 00:20:15.400
and I've always thought
that you're really great.

00:20:15.400 --> 00:20:18.400
Please go out with me.

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:21.150
He's proposing!
What will you do, Tsuyoshi-kun?

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:22.400
Aya-chan is being taken away!

00:20:22.400 --> 00:20:24.740
W- w- what should I do!?

00:20:24.740 --> 00:20:28.410
Um... I...

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:32.750
I'm sorry. I already
have someone I like.

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:34.750
Oh, is that so?

00:20:35.750 --> 00:20:38.210
Well, I guess that's that, huh?

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:43.510
Aya-chan...

00:20:44.760 --> 00:20:46.430
Good morning, Aya-chan!

00:20:46.430 --> 00:20:48.430
Ah, Sana-chan, good morning.

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:50.430
Oh, you're wearing
a cheerful face today.

00:20:50.430 --> 00:20:52.430
Mm-hmm. I'm doing great.

00:20:52.430 --> 00:20:54.440
A- Aya-chan!

00:20:54.440 --> 00:20:56.520
Ah, Tsuyoshi-kun!

00:20:57.770 --> 00:21:01.110
Aya-chan, I'm sorry.
I've been... I've been...

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:02.440
Here.

00:21:02.440 --> 00:21:04.780
Wow, what is it? Hurry and open it!

00:21:04.780 --> 00:21:07.780
Wow, incredible!

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:08.780
They smell nice.

00:21:08.780 --> 00:21:10.540
After I got home yesterday,

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:13.460
I worked as hard as I could
making them for you, Tsuyoshi-kun.

00:21:13.460 --> 00:21:16.750
From here on, even if you do
get a present from another girl

00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:19.460
and fall for her, Tsuyoshi-kun,
it's all right.

00:21:19.460 --> 00:21:21.130
I'll just bake you
some more cookies again.

00:21:21.130 --> 00:21:23.300
I'll bake cookies again and again,

00:21:23.300 --> 00:21:25.130
and give them to you
as presents, Tsuyoshi-kun.

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:27.470
Aya-chan, thanks!

00:21:27.470 --> 00:21:29.260
"Aya" "Tsuyoshi"

00:21:27.470 --> 00:21:29.300
Ah, fantastic, fantastic!

00:21:34.730 --> 00:21:37.730
So if Tsuyoshi ever gets
a present from somebody,

00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:39.730
Sugita will bake him cookies, huh?

00:21:39.730 --> 00:21:43.740
Hold on there, you. You were just
thinking of something bad, weren't you?

00:21:43.740 --> 00:21:46.070
No I wasn't.

00:21:46.070 --> 00:21:48.700
Still, this is great. The two
of them are on good terms again,

00:21:48.700 --> 00:21:50.450
like they were before.

00:21:50.450 --> 00:21:56.000
Which means... Tsuyoshi will never be
able to escape from these cookies, huh?

00:21:57.420 --> 00:21:59.080
Ooh, that's scary.

00:21:59.080 --> 00:22:03.130
Tsuyoshi has been nabbed by a girl
while still in grade school.

00:22:03.130 --> 00:22:08.590
Sana-chan, Akito-kun, sorry to
make you worry. We're fine now.

00:22:17.770 --> 00:22:20.770
"I've loved you for
a long time, Tsuyoshi-kun"

00:22:20.770 --> 00:22:24.150
W- w- what should I do?

00:22:24.150 --> 00:22:26.820
You're not at all fine!

00:22:26.820 --> 00:22:30.070
Sorry to keep you waiting,
Tsuyoshi-kun. Shall we go?

00:22:30.070 --> 00:22:31.830
Aya-chan!

00:22:32.740 --> 00:22:36.080
I- I'm a hopeless boy!

00:22:36.080 --> 00:22:38.790
Hey, Tsuyoshi...

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:42.290
"Back against the wall."

00:22:42.790 --> 00:22:47.800
That's what you say about times like these.

00:22:49.050 --> 00:22:52.550
In dire straits,

00:22:53.310 --> 00:22:56.140
I've been waiting for an answer.

00:22:56.640 --> 00:23:00.020
My confessions are worked out
long in advance,

00:23:00.980 --> 00:23:05.070
to always go along with the scenario.

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:11.110
My heart may be settled, but my mind is in a...

00:23:11.360 --> 00:23:13.330
...panic!!

00:23:14.330 --> 00:23:19.160
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:21.880
he's there.

00:23:22.790 --> 00:23:25.130
And our usual classroom...

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.760
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:27.840 --> 00:23:30.260
...for two.

00:23:31.090 --> 00:23:33.720
Although I've said nothing but wisecracks...

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:38.480
...up to now, just for today,

00:23:39.390 --> 00:23:42.060
I'm going to be honest and sincere,

00:23:42.230 --> 00:23:46.730
so BOY, take a look my way!

00:23:47.650 --> 00:23:52.320
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:52.490 --> 00:23:54.990
he's there,

00:23:55.950 --> 00:23:58.160
And our usual classroom...

00:23:58.410 --> 00:24:00.790
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:24:00.910 --> 00:24:03.290
...for two.

00:24:06.540 --> 00:24:09.550
Hoy! In Sana-chan's next adventures...

00:24:09.550 --> 00:24:12.880
Here she comes! Mother's mother!
Remember her?

00:24:12.880 --> 00:24:14.260
She's my Grandma Shizuka,
who runs a resort named Kurata Inn

00:24:14.260 --> 00:24:15.220
in the Kusatsu hot springs.

00:24:15.220 --> 00:24:17.560
As promised, we're going
to the Kusatsu hot springs!

00:24:17.560 --> 00:24:20.020
Huh? How come the
Hayama family has come, too?

00:24:20.020 --> 00:24:21.560
This smells like another conspiracy.

00:24:21.560 --> 00:24:23.560
Next time on Kodomo no Omocha,
Episode 36;

00:24:23.560 --> 00:24:26.900
Sana-chan's family's decisive strike
on location at the Kusatsu hot springs,

00:24:26.900 --> 00:24:30.820
Take Me To Kusatsu

00:24:30.820 --> 00:24:32.240
An action-packed installment,

00:24:32.240 --> 00:24:34.910
where we'll get to sing
"Kusatsu is such a nice place"!
